/news/article-16262075/halloween-teen-shot-prank-florida-parents.html", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Wakanda scientist parents say white homeowner should be arrested after shooting their moron son, 16, who went around kicking doors in at 11pm as a Halloween prank.", "last_comment_created": 1793824495126, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 58, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "The 16-year-old boy was shot around 11pm in the Shenandoah area of Davie, which is about 32 miles north of Miami.", "large_image": "CUDOrzISCfNf05yg.png", "title": "Florida parents say homeowner should be arrested after shooting son"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYwRR59", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 50, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8922943, "raw_content": "Something's not right with the results. I can see Lady Lindsey's sister not making the cut, but most everything else feels way off. The crowds that Trump drew in his midterm rallies were huge. The attention and apparent revulsion to Sayed and Talifreako seemed like a definite loss was in the cards - yet they won? Not buying it. Am I living that much in a bubble? What I think is happening is part of Trumps plan. He is nothing if not an unconventional strategist. He disallows being predictable. By allowing them to cheat and appear to win, all of the planned riots and terror have been avoided. They are going to be cocky and loose with their comms. HSA, FBI, CIA, etc. are going to amass actual comms data now, and data regarding the voting by re-counting all the paper ballots and analyzing the machine data. In the time between now and them being sworn in, Trump is going to expose them all. There will be mass arrests - likely all of them simultaneously country-wide. The low level folks are going to sing and implicate many many more. Trump does not lose. Do not lose hope frens. Justice is definitely coming. I feel it in my bones.", "author": "AROTUS", "created": 1793822230614, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Comntrinchief", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I don't believe it", "last_comment_created": 1793834919527, "content": "<p>Something's not right with the results. I can see Lady Lindsey's sister not making the cut, but most everything else feels way off. The crowds that Trump drew in his midterm rallies were huge. The attention and apparent revulsion to Sayed and Talifreako seemed like a definite loss was in the cards - yet they won? Not buying it. Am I living that much in a bubble? What I think is happening is part of Trumps plan. He is nothing if not an unconventional strategist. He disallows being predictable. By allowing them to cheat and appear to win, all of the planned riots and terror have been avoided. They are going to be cocky and loose with their comms. HSA, FBI, CIA, etc. are going to amass actual comms data now, and data regarding the voting by re-counting all the paper ballots and analyzing the machine data. In the time between now and them being sworn in, Trump is going to expose them all. There will be mass arrests - likely all of them simultaneously country-wide. The low level folks are going to sing and implicate many many more. Trump does not lose. Do not lose hope frens. Justice is definitely coming. I feel it in my bones.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 29, "score_up": 50, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYwRR9H", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 49, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8922953, "raw_content": "Can we stop with the dooming for fuck sakes. Charlie Kirk would have accepted it was a bad night but would wake up today ready to keep fighting for 2028. \n\nYes it was a shit show of an night but are you just going to lie down and let them keep winning or actually start doing something about it. ", "author": "MagaMan91", "created": 1793822475898, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "TrumpPatriot84", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Charlie Kirk would not be dooming..", "last_comment_created": 1793828997659, "content": "<p>Can we stop with the dooming for fuck sakes. Charlie Kirk would have accepted it was a bad night but would wake up today ready to keep fighting for 2028.</p>\n<p>Yes it was a shit show of an night but are you just going to lie down and let them keep winning or actually start doing something about it.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 14, "score_up": 49, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "